questration reduction to their portion of the final payment.,,,,,,,,,No Established Rate,162.51,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges.,160.9,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges.,164.12,,,,,,,Other,"Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. This will be paid in addition to other contracted rates. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges. See CMS website for additional modifier reduction percentages if applicable. In the event this service is done by a midlevel provider, the amount payable will be 85% of the normal rate. Insurance Provider will apply a 2% sequestration reduction to their portion of the final payment.",0.04,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Rate of Medicare Reimbursement. Mid level reductions would be applied using CMS criteria.,185.04,,,,,,,Other,"Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. This will be paid in addition to other contracted rates. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges. See CMS website for additional modifier reduction percentages if applicable. In the event this service is done by a midlevel provider, the amount payable will be 85% of the normal rate. Insurance Provider will apply a 2% sequestration reduction to their portion of the final payment.",0.04,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Line item reimbursement is determined by multiplying the billed units times the base fee schedule amount times the contracted percentage. Line item payments will be the lesser of billed charges or the contracted rate. This service will pay in addition to other services billed on the claim.,0.05,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Lesser of Line Item Charge or Contractual Rate percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. This will be paid in addition to other contracted rates. Line payment will not exceed line item gross charges.,160.9,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges. Insurance Provider will apply a 2% sequestration reduction to their portion of the final payment.,0.05,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Rate of Medicare Reimbursement. This will be paid in addition to other contracted rates. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges.,0.07,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Rates are as established as total billed charges times the contract percentage.,168.95,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Total Charges or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges. Insurance Provider will apply a 2% sequestration reduction to their portion of the final payment.,180,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges. Insurance Provider will apply a 2% sequestration reduction to their portion of the final payment.,,,,,,,,,No Established Rate,0.03,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Mid level provider reduction may apply to reimbursement rate.  Rates are established as the lesser of billed units times fee schedule rate times the contract percentage or line charges.,0.03,,,,,,,Fee Schedule,Mid level provider reduction may apply to reimbursement rate.  Rates are established as the lesser of billed units times fee schedule rate times the contract percentage or line charges.,160.9,,,,,,,Other,Lesser of Line Item or Contractual Percentage of Medicare Reimbursement. Total payment will not exceed total gross charges.,0.085,,,,,,,Other,Covered services are paid at the contracted % times total billed charges.,0.02,185.04,
