e for this line under this contract.,,,,,,,,,No established rate for this line under this contract.,,,,,,,,,No established rate for this line under this contract.,1.139,,,,,,,Other,"Payment rate applies to line item charges for inpatient carveouts.  Paid in addition to other negotiated rates.   If Total Billed Charges exceed $100,000 (Threshold), then negotiated rates are not applicable, and payment is calculated as 60% of Total Billed Charges for entire claim. ",1.139,1.139,
TUBE PENROSE DRAIN 18INX5/8IN,SUP-8888515403,CDM,C1729,HCPCS,278,RC,,,,,,,,,,,,outpatient,,,1.34,1.0184,0.871,,,,,,,Other,"Percent of line item charge will apply to services that are covered, but do not have a specific term set forth in the contract. These lines would not price if billed with services for which reimbursement is a case rate or applicable to all billed charges.",,,,,,,,,No established rate,0.603,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges. CMS will reduce final payment by 2% sequestration reduction for non patient portion.,0.737,,,,,,,Other,Service paid at the contracted percent of line charge.  Other types of services may be payable on the same claim.  See those lines for their  rates. If billed with a surgical procedure this service would be considered ancillary and not separately reimbursed.  Total payment will not exceed charges.,1.005,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,This percentage is applicable to all billed charges.,1.091832,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Payment calculated by multiplying total gross charges by the contracted percentage.,0.603,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges. CMS will reduce final payment by 2% sequestration reduction for non patient portion.,0.52815028,,,,,,,percent of total billed charges,The payment for this service will be limited to the lesser of listed terms or gross charges.,0.60903,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,,,,,,,,,No established rate when billed from a clinic setting,0.603,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,,,,,,,,,No established rate when billed from a clinic setting,0.60903,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,0.737,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,0.61506,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges. CMS will reduce final payment by 2% sequestration reduction for non patient portion.,1.072,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"The rate is applicable to all billed charges.  The charges on this line only represent 1 unit charge of this particular service.  To understand the total payment due, add all charges times the applicable units billed and apply the percent of charge to that amount.",0.69345,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,1.06932,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Payment calculated by multiplying total gross charges by the contracted percentage.,0.8978,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contracted % x Gross Charges,0.603,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges. CMS will reduce final payment by 2% sequestration reduction for non patient portion.,0.8978,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contracted % x Gross Charges,0.938,,,,,,,Percent of total billed charges,The rate is applicable to all billed charges.  ,0.63315,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,0.60903,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,,,,,,,,,No established rate when billed from a professional setting,0.871,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"Reimbursement rate here only applies if this service or item is a Covered Service and is not rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix.  If this service or item is a Covered Service and is rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix, the reimbursement for this service or item is considered included in reimbursement for the other services.  ",0.871,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"Reimbursement rate here only applies if this service or item is a Covered Service and is not rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix.  If this service or item is a Covered Service and is rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix, the reimbursement for this service or item is considered included in reimbursement for the other services.  ",0.737,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,1.005,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contact % X Gross Charges,0.52815028,1.091832,
