ion for non patient portion.,1.6,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"The rate is applicable to all billed charges.  The charges on this line only represent 1 unit charge of this particular service.  To understand the total payment due, add all charges times the applicable units billed and apply the percent of charge to that amount.",1.035,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,1.596,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Payment calculated by multiplying total gross charges by the contracted percentage.,1.34,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contracted % x Gross Charges,0.9,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges. CMS will reduce final payment by 2% sequestration reduction for non patient portion.,1.34,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contracted % x Gross Charges,1.4,,,,,,,Percent of total billed charges,The rate is applicable to all billed charges.  ,0.945,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,0.909,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,,,,,,,,,No established rate when billed from a professional setting,1.3,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"Reimbursement rate here only applies if this service or item is a Covered Service and is not rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix.  If this service or item is a Covered Service and is rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix, the reimbursement for this service or item is considered included in reimbursement for the other services.  ",1.3,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,"Reimbursement rate here only applies if this service or item is a Covered Service and is not rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix.  If this service or item is a Covered Service and is rendered in conjunction with a Covered Service subject to a Per Case, Per Visit, Per Diem, MSDRG, Per Unit, or Per Unit via Fee Schedule Payment Method under this Appendix, the reimbursement for this service or item is considered included in reimbursement for the other services.  ",1.1,,,,,,,Other,Services are reimbursed as a percentage of line item charges.,1.5,,,,,,,Percent of Total Billed Charges,Contact % X Gross Charges,0.788284,1.6296,
